{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫資訊節目《香港連場好戲》今晚（21日）播出最後一集，節目由賴慰玲（Winki）、黎諾懿擔任主持，邀請多位星級電影人帶觀眾重返經典港產片及國際大片取景現場，分享幕後拍攝點滴與故事。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Winki與黎</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:23:51.897990+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:11.223964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:17:11.223964+00:00","content_hash":"241a96ad73a6180406c4edc23de069a87dc01845acf924ab2a7da4f24d511ecf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}